    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Neovascular (wet) age-related macular degeneration, left eye, with active choroidal neovascularization: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Nonexudative age-related macular degeneration, right eye, intermediate stage: active, confirmed [S]</item></list><paragraph>Coordinated follow-up with the primary clinician is appropriate. [S]</paragraph></text>

